  "notes": [
    "Manifest is an integration handoff, not automatically consumed by current runtime.",
    "ghosty_base.png is the new coherent no-hat default. ghosty.png remains the legacy fallback.",
    "player_sprites map saved hat ids to complete unpossessed Ghosty images. Do not double-draw hats or bodies.",
    "Possessed forms use the whole spirit sprite plus exactly one standalone selected hat; none draws no hat.",
    "body_rect and body_reference_rect arrays are [x,y,width,height] in source pixels.",
    "New body_reference_rect values are visual estimates. Refine optical registration in browser; keep physical body32x39 and collision24x31.",
    "New Ghosty images use body_reference_rect. Existing spirit images use body_rect. Uniform-scale the reference to the logical body and draw the entire image around it.",
    "Backgrounds are1536x1024, exactly3:2; scale to960x640 logical drawing. Not guaranteed seamless tiling.",
    "Pumpkin Guardian uses the flying revision. Original Desktop source pack is retained.",
    "Battle background, battle_hurt, heal and hover are extra assets from the original Desktop pack."
  ],
